  "title": "Tang Dynasty",
  "summary": "The Tang dynasty ruled China from 618 to 907 (one source ends it in 906), with capitals at Chang'an and Luoyang. Li Yuan founded it after the Sui collapsed, and its legal code of 624 was later copied by Japan, Korea and Vietnam. The An Lushan rebellion, crushed in 763, left regional warlords controlling parts of the country.",
